{
  "provenance": "SYNTHETIC. Hand-built from the record shapes recorded verbatim from claude 2.1.260 (see session-auth-failure.real.json) plus the documented Anthropic message content-block shapes. It is NOT a recording: no turn on the recording machine reached the model, so no real tool_use / tool_result record could be captured. Tests that use this file prove the adapter's framing and normalization, not the runtime's behaviour. The first user frame opens a turn that does not end. The second user frame (the delivery) is echoed back exactly as --replay-user-messages does, still inside that turn, and only then does the turn finish.",
